Malis visits her grandparents' village. Their wooden stilt house stands on tall legs. Grandpa climbs a sugar palm to make sweet palm sugar. Uncle catches fish with a fishing net. In the afternoon, Malis rests in a hammock. The village chief says hello to everyone.

